TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
Albite
    -m0 1
    -m 1
    -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 1000 in 100
    -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -time true
    -kinetic_reactants true
END
